  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "すまん、咲耶\r\n近くで下ろすから、先に向かってくれるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008030010,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ、構わないよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600803/2006008030010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "少し走らないと間に合わないかもしれない\r\n俺も車を駐車場に停めたら、すぐに合流するから──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……悪いな、バタバタさせてしまって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008030020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタが謝ることなど何もないさ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600803/2006008030020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008030030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私のことを待ってくれる人がいるんだ\r\n本当はいつだって、駆け足で向かいたいくらいだよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600803/2006008030030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶らしいな……\r\nでも、無理はしないでくれよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008030040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "クス。心配してくれているのかい？\r\nありがとう、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600803/2006008030040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008030050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタも、急いで事故など起こさないようにね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600803/2006008030050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとう\r\n俺なら大丈夫だよ、安全運転を心がけてるしな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008030060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、それなら安心したよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600803/2006008030060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008030070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタに何かあったら、私はアナタを急がせた\r\n罪悪感で何をしてしまうかわからないからね……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600803/2006008030070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ええっ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008030080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私の愚行を見て、\r\nアナタはどう思うだろうか……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600803/2006008030080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008030090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ……\r\nそんなことにならなければいいのだけれど……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600803/2006008030090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "わ、わかってるって\r\nそうならないように、充分気を付けるから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008030100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ……本当かい？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600803/2006008030100"
  },
  {
    "select": "心配しすぎだ",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "気を付けて行くよ",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "咲耶を待たせてるからな",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "text": "★選択肢①【心配しすぎだ】",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "心配しすぎだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008030110,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "おや、その言葉は心外だよ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "fade_out",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600803/2006008030110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008030120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "こんなふうに言い合ったのが\r\n今生の別れになるかもしれないんだ",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600803/2006008030120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008030130,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタは私に、『あの時もっと言っておけば』\r\nなんて後悔をさせたいのかな？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600803/2006008030130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうだな、言葉が悪かった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "すまない、咲耶\r\nちゃんと気を付けるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008030140,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……私も、強く言い過ぎたね\r\nつい意固地になってしまった",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "006",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600803/2006008030140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008030150,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "しかし、アナタが私を心配してくれるように……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600803/2006008030150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008030160,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私も、アナタのことを想ってるんだよ\r\n……それだけは、理解してほしい",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600803/2006008030160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……\r\nありがとう、咲耶",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008030170,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、わかってくれたのならいいんだ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600803/2006008030170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008030180,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それじゃあ、焦らずに行こう\r\nお互いのために……今日のよりよい仕事のために、ね",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600803/2006008030180"
  },
