  {
    "text": "★選択肢②【気を付けて行くよ】",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "気を付けて行くよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008030190,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ、そうしてくれると嬉しいな",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600803/2006008030190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008030200,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私だけ先に行って、アナタが来てくれないなんて\r\n耐えられないからね",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600803/2006008030200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ……咲耶のためにも、安全運転を心がけるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろん、咲耶もだからな\r\n急ぐとは言っても、焦りすぎるなよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "走って転んだり、よそ見して車にぶつかったり……\r\nあ、スタジオの廊下も走るなよ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008030210,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "クス。まるで先生に諭されている気分だね",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600803/2006008030210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008030220,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタにそう言われるのも、悪い気はしないのだけれど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600803/2006008030220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008030230,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "小さな子どもじゃないんだ、きちんと自制するよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600803/2006008030230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "頼むぞ？　俺が元気に向かったのに\r\n咲耶がいなかったなんてことになったら、困るからな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008030240,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ……\r\n私もアナタを困らせたくはないからね",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600803/2006008030240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008030250,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタが来てくれるなら\r\n私は必ず待っているよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600803/2006008030250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008030260,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "だから、私がどこにいても……\r\nアナタはまっすぐに、私のもとへ辿り着いて欲しいな",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600803/2006008030260"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
