  {
    "text": "★選択肢③【咲耶を待たせてるからな】",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶を待たせてるからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008030270,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、それは光栄だね",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600803/2006008030270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008030280,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "では、アナタが来た時には完璧に仕事を終えている……\r\nなんてことをして、アナタを驚かせようか",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600803/2006008030280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ええっ？\r\nまさか、流石に咲耶でも……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008030290,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "クス。そこまで驚いてくれると言った甲斐があるな",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600803/2006008030290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "じょ、冗談か……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008030300,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、\r\nさすがにそれは、私でも実現できそうにないからね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600803/2006008030300"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008030310,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "だけど、アナタが着いた時には\r\n仕事がスムーズに進むよう、努めておくよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600803/2006008030310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、助かるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "fade_out"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008030320,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "いや、お礼を言うのは私の方さ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600803/2006008030320"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008030330,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタの言葉のおかげで、\r\nアナタを待つ間も安心して仕事を進めていられそうだ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "006",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600803/2006008030330"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008030340,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私が待っていると言えば\r\nアナタは必ず来てくれる……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
